{
  "$defs": {
    "DigitalPayoutType": {
      "description": "Payout type for digital (binary) options.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "cash_or_nothing",
          "description": "Pays a fixed cash amount in the payout currency if ITM at expiry.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "asset_or_nothing",
          "description": "Pays one unit of the foreign (base) currency if ITM at expiry.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    "FxDigitalOption": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "FX digital (binary) option instrument.\n\nPays a fixed cash amount if the option expires in-the-money.\nTwo payout types:\n- Cash-or-nothing: pays a fixed amount in the payout currency\n- Asset-or-nothing: pays the spot rate (one unit of foreign currency)\n\n# Pricing\n\nUses Garman-Kohlhagen adapted formulas:\n\n**Cash-or-nothing call**: `PV = e^{-r_d T} × N(d2) × payout_amount`\n**Cash-or-nothing put**: `PV = e^{-r_d T} × N(-d2) × payout_amount`\n**Asset-or-nothing call**: `PV = S × e^{-r_f T} × N(d1) × notional`\n**Asset-or-nothing put**: `PV = S × e^{-r_f T} × N(-d1) × notional`\n\n# References\n\n- Reiner, E., & Rubinstein, M. (1991). \"Unscrambling the Binary Code.\"\n  *Risk Magazine*, 4(9), 75-83. `docs/REFERENCES.md#reiner-rubinstein-1991`\n- Wystup, U. (2006). *FX Options and Structured Products*. Wiley. `docs/REFERENCES.md#wystup-fx-options`",
      "properties": {
        "attributes": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/attributes.schema.json",
          "description": "Attributes for scenario selection and grouping"
        },
        "base_currency": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/currency.schema.json",
          "description": "Base currency (foreign currency)"
        },
        "day_count": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/day_count.schema.json",
          "default": "act_365f",
          "description": "Day count convention (defaults to ACT/365F)."
        },
        "domestic_discount_curve_id": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/id.schema.json",
          "description": "Domestic currency discount curve ID"
        },
        "expiry": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/date.schema.json",
          "description": "Option expiry date"
        },
        "foreign_discount_curve_id": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/id.schema.json",
          "description": "Foreign currency discount curve ID"
        },
        "id": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/id.schema.json",
          "description": "Unique instrument identifier"
        },
        "instrument_pricing_overrides": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/instrument_pricing_overrides.schema.json",
          "description": "Instrument-owned pricing inputs."
        },
        "metric_pricing_overrides": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/metric_pricing_overrides.schema.json",
          "description": "Metric-time pricing configuration."
        },
        "notional": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/money.schema.json",
          "description": "Notional amount in base currency"
        },
        "option_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/OptionType",
          "description": "Option type (call or put on base currency)"
        },
        "payout_amount": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/money.schema.json",
          "description": "Fixed payout amount (used for cash-or-nothing; for asset-or-nothing this\nis the notional of foreign currency delivered)"
        },
        "payout_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/DigitalPayoutType",
          "description": "Payout type (cash-or-nothing or asset-or-nothing)"
        },
        "quote_currency": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/currency.schema.json",
          "description": "Quote currency (domestic currency)"
        },
        "scenario_pricing_overrides": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/scenario_pricing_overrides.schema.json",
          "description": "Scenario-only pricing adjustments."
        },
        "strike": {
          "description": "Strike exchange rate (quote per base)",
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "vol_surface_id": {
          "$ref": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/common/1/id.schema.json",
          "description": "FX volatility surface ID"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "base_currency",
        "quote_currency",
        "strike",
        "option_type",
        "payout_type",
        "payout_amount",
        "expiry",
        "notional",
        "domestic_discount_curve_id",
        "foreign_discount_curve_id",
        "vol_surface_id",
        "attributes"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "InstrumentSchema": {
      "const": "finstack_quant.instrument/1",
      "description": "Canonical schema marker for persisted instrument envelopes.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "OptionType": {
      "description": "Option payoff direction used by analytical and numerical model engines.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "call",
          "description": "Call option.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "put",
          "description": "Put option.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    "fx_digital_option": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "spec": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/FxDigitalOption"
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "fx_digital_option",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "type",
        "spec"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://finstack_quant.dev/schemas/instrument/1/fx/fx_digital_option.schema.json",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Canonical single-instrument v1 envelope generated from its serde type.",
  "examples": [
    {
      "instrument": {
        "spec": {
          "attributes": {},
          "base_currency": "EUR",
          "day_count": "act_365f",
          "domestic_discount_curve_id": "USD-OIS",
          "expiry": "2030-06-21",
          "foreign_discount_curve_id": "EUR-OIS",
          "id": "FXDIG-EURUSD-CALL",
          "notional": {
            "amount": "1000000",
            "currency": "EUR"
          },
          "option_type": "call",
          "payout_amount": {
            "amount": "1000000",
            "currency": "USD"
          },
          "payout_type": "cash_or_nothing",
          "quote_currency": "USD",
          "strike": 1.12,
          "vol_surface_id": "EURUSD-VOL"
        },
        "type": "fx_digital_option"
      },
      "schema": "finstack_quant.instrument/1"
    }
  ],
  "properties": {
    "instrument": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/fx_digital_option"
    },
    "schema": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/InstrumentSchema"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "instrument"
  ],
  "title": "fx_digital_option",
  "type": "object"
}
